{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dcd6c42d3f09efb83dafef5e685e0e420ba5ef0d6379ede515a0746456bbef24", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n育は、なんだか機嫌が良さそうだ……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的日子。\n育看起来心情特别好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "e9e1a6317c18dbf3500b18f2df9a11b5a23173bdf3a6e5759bcef5f599025a44", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん！\nどうかな？　パジャマ似合ってる！？", "zh": "那个那个，{$P$}先生！\n怎么样？这身睡衣适合我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aaa30e7112742e99f2c8f6ceded325c3170845e50d1cad1cd41a8a51e352638f", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\n育にピッタリだ！", "zh": "啊，很适合你哦。\n简直和育太配了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "6c20588d37f2bbf38370628c1cdbd20d02bfc4c56e818273ab4452060b484da6", "ja": "やった！　わたしね、このパジャマ気に入っちゃった♪\n触るとふわふわモコモコしてるのもだーい好き！", "zh": "太好了！我呀，可喜欢这身睡衣了♪\n摸起来软绵绵毛茸茸的，超——喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "c515f85e1e6367341690d6591dd8941ddad182be01467556e4bfd82c60284afe", "ja": "それに着るとね、とってもあったかいの！\nなんだかうさぎさんと一緒にいるみたい♪", "zh": "而且穿上之后特别暖和！\n感觉就像和小兔子待在一起一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1005_p", "source_sha256": "74d85276cc001aef8ba410eee44cd343d5a2f7c6072ca2ef831321ac24a67186", "ja": "一緒に？　耳や尻尾もついてて、\n育がうさぎになったみたいに見えるけど……。", "zh": "一起？还带着耳朵和尾巴，看起来就像育变成兔子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "a7fde6d219802f8d757d1115f2d4cebf24b480e1191b217d16b14d494519b328", "ja": "もう、違うよ！　あったかいうさぎさんが、\nわたしのことを守ってるんだよ！", "zh": "真是的，才不是啦！是暖洋洋的小兔子，\n在保护着我呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "8be353ae09bad493bb4d994591376143ef48dc72825f4ed9e02e1256dc01e833", "ja": "あっ。うさぎさんのパジャマと一緒なら、\n今度こそ、夜ふかしもできちゃうかも！", "zh": "啊。要是穿着小兔子睡衣的话，\n下次说不定真的能熬夜了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1008_p", "source_sha256": "05c88c193731b941e057125b0f073b0589189600c03fff8ace53c574ca69245e", "ja": "えっ？　夜ふかし？", "zh": "诶？熬夜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "be6aeac861f1cc039bbf4a030322c197f59c46b14d8ce31a821439917a767dee", "ja": "うん。夜ふかしって、大人の人がすることだよね？\nだから、わたしもやってみたいなって。", "zh": "嗯。熬夜是大人才会做的事，对吧？\n所以，我也想试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "ecadf9f2ce8697911aca9ace8a0eafe2baa30a69f70e2e0f8a10ddb3ad4bf93b", "ja": "いつもがんばって起きてるんだけど、\nすぐ眠くなっちゃって……失敗しちゃうんだ。", "zh": "我每次都很努力想要醒着，\n但马上就犯困了……总是失败呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb5034ed3060acf989abf068e306a9851df93721acd7d1b4c92ceee1d0a2781b", "ja": "でも、このパジャマがあれば、きっと大丈夫！\nだって、うさぎさんと一緒なんだもん！", "zh": "不过，有这套睡衣在，就一定没问题！因为有兔兔陪着我嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1012_p", "source_sha256": "39f5cc970d191721228510211e16ff3494232edb0c100f5696e7df93585522e0", "ja": "なるほどな。たしかに、起きてくれる相手がいれば、\n眠気もなくなりそうだ。次はうまくいくといいな。", "zh": "这样啊。确实，有个能叫醒我的人，感觉连困意都会消失。希望下次能顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "9b491c452105cba3ec2815a23449f45d5907d5e886344c2999c624e7c4a24a87", "ja": "うん！　次は、日にちが変わるまで起きるんだ！\n{$P$}さん、応えんしてね♪", "zh": "嗯！下次要一直醒到跨日为止！\n{$P$}先生，要给我加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e2bfdafccc119670dd8fa08d3a7cddb0839386b34eb547545a999ebc317de138", "ja": "もちろんだよ。でも、夜更しは程々にな！\n朝、起きられなくなったら大変だ。", "zh": "当然可以。不过，熬夜要适度啊！要是早上起不来，可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "d43ac2789e65692c82c1217d99152c68a97cebfe049d6f26cc54ef011de8ac86", "ja": "あっ、そうだね。次の日も元気に過ごせるのが、\n大人の夜ふかしだもんね！", "zh": "啊，对哦。能让第二天也精神满满，才叫大人的熬夜嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4597a1a3b4e56500fc6cbbbdc49cc8e9a4c42420897a4962ab9e7c084f59e11e", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。そうやって、\n先のことまで考えられるなんて偉いな、育！", "zh": "是、是啊……能像那样连以后的事都考虑到，真了不起啊，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "3f74fa1963a0a7bfa327d8045e5bac0cf6fd6c0136eae53d1dc524362079fdbf", "ja": "えへへ♪　今日の撮影、わたしに任せて♪\nうさぎさんと一緒に、かわいい写真にするから！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 今天的拍摄就交给我吧♪  \n我会和小兔子一起，拍出可爱的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bd7fe5165af339ed63425fe08d3b4e446d56238119e3313dd349ab11c4b0ef06", "ja": "ああ！　期待してるぞ！", "zh": "啊！我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0293_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f94a427f4d336cb4712df26596b31de99de30af9769ed49d8d0cf30fd591cc06", "ja": "（撮影は順調に進み、かわいい写真に仕上がった。\nこの衣装となら、育の夜更しもすぐ成功しそうだな！）", "zh": "（拍摄顺利进行着，最后拍出了可爱的照片。穿着这套服装的话，育熬夜的计划似乎很快就能成功了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
